WEBVTT

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:32.805
and the actual act of bearing witness.

00:00:34.070 --> 00:00:36.988
Bearing witness means writing down
something you have seen,

00:00:37.012 --> 00:00:38.621
something you have heard,

00:00:38.645 --> 00:00:40.457
something you have experienced.

00:00:40.975 --> 00:00:44.677
The most important part
of bearing witness is writing it down,

00:00:44.701 --> 00:00:45.925
it's recording.

00:00:46.806 --> 00:00:50.398
Writing it down captures the memory.

00:00:51.279 --> 00:00:55.236
Writing it down
acknowledges its existence.

00:00:56.204 --> 00:00:59.544
One of the biggest examples
we have in history

00:00:59.568 --> 00:01:03.087
of someone bearing witness
is Anne Frank's diary.